WEBVTT

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.925
<i>Yum...</i>

00:01:33.761 --> 00:01:38.766
Shana. I'm going
to change your destiny.

00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:45.564
That was my decision.

00:01:48.943 --> 00:01:51.654
On that Christmas Eve...

00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:07.628
Tomorrow, December 24th,
at 1900 hours,

00:02:07.837 --> 00:02:10.548
come to the Illumination Festa,
commemorating the opening

00:02:10.756 --> 00:02:13.259
of Misaki Station's clock tower.

00:02:13.467 --> 00:02:17.054
Please come to see one of us.

00:03:07.355 --> 00:03:09.398
I made up my mind.

00:03:13.778 --> 00:03:15.613
That's why...

00:03:16.739 --> 00:03:19.867
Yuji, l...

00:03:24.288 --> 00:03:28.584
That day, Yuji
vanished from this city.

00:03:47.269 --> 00:03:50.898
<i>Now set free</i>

00:03:51.107 --> 00:03:57.279
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:03:57.488 --> 00:04:01.158
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:04:01.367 --> 00:04:07.206
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:04:07.415 --> 00:04:09.750
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:04:09.959 --> 00:04:12.378
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:04:12.586 --> 00:04:14.922
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:04:15.131 --> 00:04:19.802
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:22.346
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:04:22.555 --> 00:04:25.015
<i>Shout out</i>

00:04:25.224 --> 00:04:27.643
<i>Your existence</i>

00:04:27.852 --> 00:04:32.731
<i>Cry out</i>

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.151
<i>Shout out</i>

00:04:35.526 --> 00:04:37.903
<i>Shout out</i>

00:04:38.112 --> 00:04:40.489
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:04:40.698 --> 00:04:48.622
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:04:48.831 --> 00:04:55.212
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:19.403
Shana-chan.

00:05:19.612 --> 00:05:21.197
It's almost time.

00:05:21.405 --> 00:05:22.823
Right.

00:05:24.283 --> 00:05:27.203
Watching you jump around

00:05:27.411 --> 00:05:31.248
makes our small yard
seem even smaller.

00:05:31.457 --> 00:05:35.002
Shouldn't you go
somewhere with more space?

00:05:35.211 --> 00:05:39.048
But then you'd have no reason
to come over every morning, right?

00:05:39.256 --> 00:05:42.927
Even on the nicest mornings,
I get lonely if there's no one else here.

00:05:43.135 --> 00:05:45.638
You're not alone.

00:05:45.846 --> 00:05:47.389
That's true.

00:05:47.598 --> 00:05:51.852
Once the baby's born,
it'll get a lot more lively here.

00:05:55.898 --> 00:05:58.025
Okay! Time for
the new semester, right?

00:05:58.234 --> 00:06:00.402
You should start getting ready.

00:06:00.611 --> 00:06:02.029
Yeah.

00:06:15.251 --> 00:06:17.419
Oh, Shana-chan...

00:06:21.257 --> 00:06:23.008
Now it's bath time.

00:06:23.217 --> 00:06:24.635
Yeah...

00:06:38.274 --> 00:06:40.526
His cup's gone, too. Yuji's...

00:06:40.734 --> 00:06:41.610
Yeah.

00:06:41.819 --> 00:06:44.363
That one he liked.

00:06:44.572 --> 00:06:46.532
He always chose
it for drinking his tea.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:53.330
When a Torch disappears, nothing about
the original human will have existed.

00:06:53.539 --> 00:06:55.374
Unless they already
knew about the Crimson World,

00:06:55.583 --> 00:07:00.546
even one's own family won't
remember anything about them.

00:07:00.754 --> 00:07:02.673
I know that.

00:07:13.142 --> 00:07:16.312
Yuji doesn't live here anymore.

00:07:18.897 --> 00:07:20.899
I'm sorry, Shana!

00:07:24.445 --> 00:07:26.071
I know that.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.503
"A Lost Being"

00:07:57.394 --> 00:07:58.896
"Sakai"

00:07:59.104 --> 00:08:00.439
"lshida"

00:08:01.565 --> 00:08:03.192
I know that.

00:08:07.196 --> 00:08:10.366
Kazumi... Happy New Year!

00:08:10.574 --> 00:08:12.576
You're late...

00:08:12.785 --> 00:08:15.746
I was really lonely here,
without everyone.

00:08:15.954 --> 00:08:16.872
Everyone?

00:08:17.081 --> 00:08:22.628
Shana-chan's not here, Sato's absent,
and Ike-kun's at student council.

00:08:22.836 --> 00:08:23.754
I see.

00:08:23.962 --> 00:08:27.299
Sorry! Of course, there was one other...

00:08:27.508 --> 00:08:31.136
You weren't here, Kazumi.
I missed you!

00:08:31.345 --> 00:08:33.972
You're still lonely,
even with Tanaka here?

00:08:34.181 --> 00:08:36.392
What are you talking about?

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:37.434
--What's Tanaka got to do with this?

00:08:37.643 --> 00:08:41.897
--He's gone. No one remembers Sakai-kun
anymore. --What's Tanaka got to do with this?

00:08:42.106 --> 00:08:45.234
Look at her blush!
She's so cute when she blushes!

00:08:46.944 --> 00:08:48.696
Kazumi Yoshida-san.

00:08:48.904 --> 00:08:51.490
I'm in love with you.

00:08:58.455 --> 00:09:00.624
Happy New Year, Yoshida-san.

00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:03.627
Happy New Year, lke-kun.

00:09:03.836 --> 00:09:05.254
Hey...

00:09:05.462 --> 00:09:07.256
Right, right.

00:09:07.464 --> 00:09:09.133
I got these steamed
buns for you as a present!

00:09:09.341 --> 00:09:12.344
Try one!
Come on, give it a try.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.269
Shana-chan.

00:09:28.944 --> 00:09:30.821
Shana-chan...

00:09:32.531 --> 00:09:34.366
That day...

00:09:40.038 --> 00:09:46.044
I thought Sakai-kun chose Shana-chan.

00:09:48.839 --> 00:09:50.466
Yuji is...

00:10:47.981 --> 00:10:50.526
Back then,

00:10:50.734 --> 00:10:53.612
I thought everything was over.

00:10:53.821 --> 00:10:57.241
But not anymore...

00:10:57.449 --> 00:10:59.451
We have hope now.

00:11:00.619 --> 00:11:03.997
That's right. Yuji isn't gone.

00:11:09.586 --> 00:11:12.798
Yuji Sakai. What
are you thinking about?

00:11:13.006 --> 00:11:16.385
About the Flame Hazes
and the Crimson Denizens.

00:11:16.593 --> 00:11:19.429
The Flame Hazes and the Crimson Denizens.

00:11:19.638 --> 00:11:21.473
Isn't there some way?

00:11:21.682 --> 00:11:23.600
There is not.

00:11:23.809 --> 00:11:28.355
Denizens of the Crimson World devour the
power of existence that belongs to humans.

00:11:28.564 --> 00:11:33.402
They destroy existence
and create rifts in the world.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:36.655
They care nothing for
what their actions may mean,

00:11:36.864 --> 00:11:39.449
worrying only for themselves.

00:11:39.658 --> 00:11:41.910
Isn't there some way?

00:11:42.119 --> 00:11:44.288
There is not.

00:11:44.496 --> 00:11:49.793
But tools, known as Flame Hazes,
were created to stop the great disaster

00:11:50.002 --> 00:11:52.838
that is said to result from the rifts.

00:11:53.046 --> 00:11:55.674
They fight an endless battle.

00:11:55.883 --> 00:11:58.802
Tools... An endless battle.

00:11:59.011 --> 00:12:00.387
Yes.

00:12:00.596 --> 00:12:02.556
What should I do?

00:12:04.099 --> 00:12:05.726
What should I...

00:12:13.817 --> 00:12:19.740
Honestly, not having that
Mystes kid here is a real problem.

00:12:19.948 --> 00:12:21.617
Yeah, I guess...

00:12:21.825 --> 00:12:24.328
But he simply isn't here.

00:12:24.536 --> 00:12:27.789
He's not gone for good.
Or so the brat thinks.

00:12:27.998 --> 00:12:31.126
I'm sure she doesn't want to believe it.

00:12:31.335 --> 00:12:33.545
It isn't a question of belief.

00:12:33.754 --> 00:12:36.340
To her, the question's already settled.

00:12:36.548 --> 00:12:40.802
Otherwise, she wouldn't be asking for
my help to work on her Unrestricted Methods.

00:12:41.011 --> 00:12:43.472
Yeah, and she really
is serious about coming here.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:45.682
But I never took you for a teacher.

00:12:45.891 --> 00:12:49.937
If a drinking buddy came begging, then sure...

00:12:50.145 --> 00:12:55.609
Anyway, the brat and company are
already thinking ahead to the next battle.

00:12:57.194 --> 00:12:58.820
Ball Masque...

00:13:01.698 --> 00:13:06.745
Wilhelmina thinks the thing with Yuji,
as well as the recent random attacks

00:13:06.954 --> 00:13:11.458
on the Outlaw posts, are all part
of something they're planning.

00:13:11.667 --> 00:13:14.086
I agree.

00:13:14.294 --> 00:13:16.546
And this town...

00:13:16.755 --> 00:13:18.882
It may be a Maelstrom of Conflict.

00:13:19.091 --> 00:13:21.468
A place that draws battles to itself.

00:13:21.677 --> 00:13:24.513
So that's why you've plopped
your big ass down here.

00:13:24.721 --> 00:13:27.975
It's probably a better
idea than aimless wandering.

00:13:28.183 --> 00:13:30.560
Don't you agree? And besides,

00:13:30.769 --> 00:13:33.397
they're certain to partake in this.

00:13:33.605 --> 00:13:36.024
The Midnight Lost Child inside Yuji.

00:13:36.233 --> 00:13:38.527
The one dwelling inside it.

00:13:40.821 --> 00:13:42.239
Silver...

00:13:43.198 --> 00:13:45.701
But at the moment, our job is to prepare.

00:13:45.909 --> 00:13:47.494
We must gather information, too.

00:13:47.703 --> 00:13:49.997
So that's why you're sending Keisaku?

00:13:50.205 --> 00:13:51.498
Of course.

00:13:51.707 --> 00:13:55.252
The Outlaw said they'd take
him in, as a message runner.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:57.212
Was that really a good idea?

00:13:57.421 --> 00:13:59.715
This is another trial for him.

00:13:59.923 --> 00:14:02.884
To see if he really can obey my directions.

00:14:03.093 --> 00:14:07.222
At times like this, I'm totally unsure
which outcome is preferable.

00:14:07.431 --> 00:14:09.224
What else?

00:14:09.433 --> 00:14:11.727
One where he, at least, survives?

00:14:11.935 --> 00:14:14.062
See you tomorrow!

00:14:14.271 --> 00:14:15.689
Yeah...

00:14:16.648 --> 00:14:19.568
I turned down visiting
Sato to see how he's doing.

00:14:19.776 --> 00:14:22.654
I wonder if Oga-chan's even noticed

00:14:22.863 --> 00:14:26.575
that I'm avoiding Margery-san.

00:14:26.783 --> 00:14:29.077
But I decided.

00:14:29.286 --> 00:14:32.164
I don't want to do that anymore... I...

00:14:32.372 --> 00:14:34.041
Yo.

00:14:34.249 --> 00:14:37.002
<i>Sate'? Where were you today'?</i>

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:39.504
I had some preparations to finish.

00:14:39.713 --> 00:14:42.215
They're all done, so I thought
I'd come and see you.

00:14:42.424 --> 00:14:44.092
Other preparations?

00:14:44.301 --> 00:14:47.137
I'm off to the Tokyo Outlaw tomorrow.

00:14:47.345 --> 00:14:48.680
Outlaw...

00:14:48.889 --> 00:14:50.932
The Flame Haze messengers?!

00:14:51.141 --> 00:14:54.770
I was accepted as a
representative of Margery-san.

00:14:54.978 --> 00:14:57.773
I don't think I have to explain
to you why I'm doing this.

00:14:57.981 --> 00:14:59.941
Sakai... Right?

00:15:01.234 --> 00:15:05.280
But Shana-chan told me
that Sakai isn't gone forever.

00:15:05.489 --> 00:15:10.619
I believe her. And that's why
I can't run away from this city.

00:15:10.827 --> 00:15:13.288
And simply being here is meaningless.

00:15:13.497 --> 00:15:17.959
Well, the place I'm headed is
really an annex of the actual Outlaw.

00:15:18.168 --> 00:15:23.673
The real place in Tokyo is still
kept secret from new kids like me.

00:15:23.882 --> 00:15:26.343
But Margery-san said to go anyway.

00:15:26.551 --> 00:15:29.638
She said to see, with my
own eyes, what I'm aiming for.

00:15:29.846 --> 00:15:31.306
Oh, really...

00:15:31.515 --> 00:15:32.933
Jealous?

00:15:34.184 --> 00:15:37.854
I'm glad you feel that way.

00:15:38.063 --> 00:15:42.359
If you'd felt nothing, after hearing that,
it would mean our paths really had split.

00:15:42.567 --> 00:15:43.777
<i>Sate...</i>

00:15:43.985 --> 00:15:49.157
See you. I'll be back soon.
Look after Margery-san while I'm gone.

00:15:49.366 --> 00:15:54.162
The old ladies only do a bare minimum
of cleaning at the bar, so as not to bother her.

00:15:54.371 --> 00:15:55.789
<i>Sate'.!</i>

00:16:00.127 --> 00:16:01.336
<i>'an.</i>

00:16:05.257 --> 00:16:08.009
Answers to the reported matter

00:16:08.218 --> 00:16:10.804
have come from all quarters, indeed.

00:16:11.012 --> 00:16:12.848
Danger foreseen.

00:16:14.307 --> 00:16:18.270
The disappearance of the Mystes with the
Treasure known as the Midnight Lost Child...

00:16:18.478 --> 00:16:22.774
The fact that the Ball Masque
was surely involved...

00:16:22.983 --> 00:16:25.861
Added to the attacks
on the Outlaw stations,

00:16:26.069 --> 00:16:29.364
these signs point toward a
large-scale plot by Ball Masque.

00:16:29.573 --> 00:16:33.368
Headquarters is reaching
that conclusion, as well.

00:16:33.577 --> 00:16:35.078
Tardy response.

00:16:35.287 --> 00:16:37.247
It cannot be helped, indeed.

00:16:37.455 --> 00:16:41.877
The Ball Masque has never used

00:16:42.085 --> 00:16:44.880
a direct attack like this before, indeed.

00:16:45.088 --> 00:16:47.215
But why the Mystes?

00:16:47.424 --> 00:16:49.134
Crucial object.

00:16:49.342 --> 00:16:55.098
Indeed. I have always felt their obsession
with the Midnight Lost Child unusual.

00:16:56.516 --> 00:17:00.187
She shows no sign of
wavering since that day, indeed...

00:17:00.395 --> 00:17:02.230
Well-being assured.

00:17:02.439 --> 00:17:06.276
But she's undoubtedly
concealing a certain uneasiness.

00:17:06.484 --> 00:17:09.196
Isn't there something I can do...

00:17:14.284 --> 00:17:15.202
I'm back.

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.245
Welcome back.

00:17:18.705 --> 00:17:20.790
Please begin the daily briefing.

00:17:20.999 --> 00:17:23.168
His seat was gone,

00:17:23.376 --> 00:17:25.295
as if he were a normal Torch.

00:17:25.503 --> 00:17:26.880
Any modification to the letter?

00:17:27.088 --> 00:17:28.506
No.

00:17:29.674 --> 00:17:34.179
Did you learn anything about
Ball Masque from today's letters?

00:17:34.387 --> 00:17:37.474
Unfortunately, they still primarily consist

00:17:37.682 --> 00:17:41.436
of fragmented information
regarding the Outlaw attacks.

00:17:41.645 --> 00:17:44.856
But nothing about the Midnight Lost Child.

00:17:45.065 --> 00:17:46.483
I see.

00:17:48.109 --> 00:17:50.654
The Braider of Trembling Might.

00:17:50.862 --> 00:17:53.949
Send Sophie Sawallisch a letter,
along with your own report.

00:17:56.034 --> 00:17:59.955
The Braider of Trembling Might is the
provisional leader of the Outlaw posts.

00:18:00.163 --> 00:18:02.123
I'm sure she has already been briefed.

00:18:02.332 --> 00:18:04.459
Write to her directly.

00:18:04.668 --> 00:18:06.294
To Sophie?

00:18:10.548 --> 00:18:12.217
Advice expected.

00:18:12.425 --> 00:18:18.348
The Braider of Trembling Might is one of
the few to whom she can speak openly, indeed.

00:18:18.556 --> 00:18:21.726
As disappointing as that is to me...

00:18:23.228 --> 00:18:26.231
But what should I say?

00:18:33.113 --> 00:18:35.991
This is all that came back.

00:18:36.199 --> 00:18:37.826
This is all...

00:18:41.204 --> 00:18:42.998
For me...

00:18:43.206 --> 00:18:44.833
And for Kazumi...

00:18:46.042 --> 00:18:48.128
One hope.

00:18:48.336 --> 00:18:49.963
Back then...

00:18:58.596 --> 00:19:00.015
<i>Yum...</i>

00:19:02.642 --> 00:19:04.519
I'll write down what happened.

00:19:04.728 --> 00:19:09.024
I'll write everything that occurred,
concealing nothing.

00:19:09.232 --> 00:19:12.068
That the Mystes Yuji Sakai...

00:19:12.277 --> 00:19:13.903
That Yuji...

00:19:15.697 --> 00:19:17.615
...isn't gone forever.

00:19:19.701 --> 00:19:21.369
Yuji Sakai...

00:19:21.578 --> 00:19:23.997
Are you thinking again?

00:19:24.205 --> 00:19:27.542
Yes. What should I do?

00:19:27.751 --> 00:19:29.502
What should I do?

00:19:29.711 --> 00:19:31.338
What do you wish?

00:19:31.546 --> 00:19:32.881
What do I wish?

00:19:33.089 --> 00:19:38.595
That's right. What do
you wish for, Yuji Sakai?

00:19:38.803 --> 00:19:40.013
<i>'An.</i>

00:20:01.785 --> 00:20:03.244
Not a flame...

00:20:03.453 --> 00:20:07.290
A physical manifestation of power,

00:20:07.499 --> 00:20:10.168
which can be grasped and wielded!

00:20:36.528 --> 00:20:39.447
You're making real progress.

00:20:39.656 --> 00:20:44.244
I guess you don't need to pause
and concentrate anymore, girlie.

00:20:44.452 --> 00:20:45.620
Not yet.

00:20:45.829 --> 00:20:51.459
I need it stable enough to hold its size,
even when swung as hard as possible.

00:20:52.877 --> 00:20:56.673
If I want to control it properly,
I can only handle it at half this size.

00:20:56.881 --> 00:21:00.260
I need to compress it further.

00:21:00.468 --> 00:21:02.303
But you don't believe that's good enough.

00:21:02.512 --> 00:21:05.974
No... I need to be stronger.

00:21:06.182 --> 00:21:08.768
So I can be ready,
regardless of what happens.

00:21:10.186 --> 00:21:12.856
Yes, no matter what may happen.

00:21:14.524 --> 00:21:18.653
This embodies Shana-chan's and my hope.

00:21:18.862 --> 00:21:21.114
Yuji isn't gone forever.

00:21:21.322 --> 00:21:22.657
However...

00:21:22.866 --> 00:21:27.036
If he were, these letters
should have vanished, as well.

00:21:27.245 --> 00:21:30.457
But they came back.

00:21:30.665 --> 00:21:32.667
Who sent them?

00:21:35.170 --> 00:21:36.546
I don't know...

00:21:36.754 --> 00:21:40.008
But as long as these exist,

00:21:40.216 --> 00:21:42.051
I'll keep faith.

00:21:43.887 --> 00:21:46.014
Yuji hasn't permanently disappeared.

00:21:46.222 --> 00:21:47.849
Absolutely not!

00:21:52.896 --> 00:21:55.064
I'll believe, too.

00:21:55.273 --> 00:21:58.026
In what Shana-chan told me.

00:21:58.234 --> 00:21:59.819
So...

00:22:00.028 --> 00:22:02.113
Please live!

00:22:02.322 --> 00:22:04.073
That's all I ask,

00:22:04.282 --> 00:22:05.783
Sakai-kun.

00:22:07.494 --> 00:22:11.039
No matter what may happen,
no matter what!

00:22:11.247 --> 00:22:12.665
Yuji!

00:22:15.418 --> 00:22:18.713
What would you like to do, Yuji Sakai?

00:22:18.922 --> 00:22:20.131
<i>'An.</i>

00:22:21.424 --> 00:22:23.510
I want to change it!

00:22:25.261 --> 00:22:28.264
Then you've made
your decision, Yuji Sakai.

00:22:28.473 --> 00:22:30.225
You are the sole human

00:22:30.433 --> 00:22:32.435
to walk alongside me.

00:23:06.469 --> 00:23:09.305
Your orders, Master?

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:12.767
The Palace of the Stars,

00:23:12.976 --> 00:23:15.478
our castle, will head west.

00:23:35.039 --> 00:23:38.001
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:38.209 --> 00:23:41.588
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:41.796 --> 00:23:44.757
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:44.966 --> 00:23:50.722
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:52.015
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:23:52.223 --> 00:23:55.310
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:23:55.518 --> 00:23:58.646
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:23:58.855 --> 00:24:02.066
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:24:02.275 --> 00:24:05.445
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:24:05.653 --> 00:24:08.781
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:12.160
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:24:12.368 --> 00:24:16.080
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:24:16.289 --> 00:24:19.000
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:24:19.208 --> 00:24:27.258
<i>The vanishing afterimage, that is you
in and of itself (So now that you & I)</i>

00:24:27.467 --> 00:24:28.509
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:24:28.718 --> 00:24:30.470
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:24:30.678 --> 00:24:34.098
<i>"I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:24:34.307 --> 00:24:37.435
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:24:37.644 --> 00:24:40.855
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:24:41.064 --> 00:24:43.900
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:24:44.108 --> 00:24:47.654
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:24:47.862 --> 00:24:50.782
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:24:50.990 --> 00:24:59.499
<i>"I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:25:02.960 --> 00:25:05.755
Yuji becomes leader of the Ball Masque,

00:25:05.963 --> 00:25:08.549
as Shana continues her training,
unaware of this development.

00:25:08.758 --> 00:25:12.845
And as Sato heads toward
the Outlaw, what will he find?

00:25:13.054 --> 00:25:15.431
Next time, on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:25:15.640 --> 00:25:16.891
"That Which Comes."
